  m_Text: 'Controls:

    wasd - Characters Movement

    Left Shift - Sprinting

    Left
    Control - Crounching

    Left Shift + Left Control - will give player character
    a burst of speed after a certian amount of time spent sprinting

    Space -
    Jump

    Tab - Pauses Game

    LeftClick - Launches you in the opposite direction
    you are facing'
